:id="m-97c45b51-f59f-4eed-bafc-7caeed140517" facs="#m-4fe062aa-c5f8-434a-9183-12995a3ede7c" label="ambiguous">S.°</l><l xml:id="m-f9b3112b-40a7-4803-91c1-a0a3b235c1e3" facs="#m-e485b9d1-158d-44ed-9501-26812454740b" label="lyrics-like">UB thró-no Dé-i “ómnes sáncti clámant: Vindi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a48c3d8a-bbc2-4140-98c5-9b95eab3405d" facs="#m-7f85dc7b-bbaf-4a1b-9e16-5c5d77eb034d" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-f9dc24d7-6aa3-490a-a9c2-25f40c85aa3f" facs="#m-74bed0f8-287d-4359-aac7-17e501c7b023" label="lyrics-like">ca sánguinem nóstrum, Dé-us nóster. E u o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-bcbb2b51-405b-4813-af69-b2d3dc392036" facs="#m-7c8d2d23-c6d6-4d5b-9b2e-26f8f1d58a65" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-7088af06-a0ba-443d-9b4b-4023737e0011" facs="#m-11cf1692-9419-46c2-a18e-e086a7c65c38" label="ambiguous">Apoc. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-2d67a56b-c7e6-48a1-ad2f-ef1ddbb9be64" facs="#m-9a5f57cf-70e5-45c4-8b2e-3a4a8ae9f9d3" label="lyrics-like">I empti sunt ex homínibus pri-] cium:* sine mácula enim sunt ante</l><l xml:id="m-b1f99d3e-49c8-4afe-b237-e2d596f194e4" facs="#m-0a32ccb4-bc2a-46b9-8ee2-ac8927e91c3f" label="ambiguous">It mitiae Deo et Agno, t et in ore! thronum Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-d1365a5b-c446-4d03-964c-28a3d4fd67d9" facs="#m-58fe5007-2a18-46db-9e74-e6ceb424a13a" label="lyrics-like">ipsórum non est invéntum mendá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0af3dc8-6d0b-41bb-899c-d1521af83d0b" facs="#m-2d0e1969-0cb7-48c7-9930-b406726780c0" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Jústi autem. V. Exsultábunt. from the Common, p. 1155.</l><l xml:id="m-b360ad74-b4a1-4ee6-8689-ab874e4bdfc3" facs="#m-0e736811-fbe9-4c64-b394-d02352992fb0" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-d001292e-f6ce-4d5a-bd39-cae01bca8a46" facs="#m-bcf8233f-9379-4674-aacc-fb937116230e" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Nativity. P. A1.</l><l xml:id="m-8858e811-02bb-4a71-9d0f-d08b87f4dcad" facs="#m-85d0d026-2484-4fe7-b10a-40d48da249e0" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f4d43fb3-7989-4c74-b